      "writtenOn": "2025-03-27T23:51:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sure Satish,\nIsn\u0027t this an extra step for the remote device which don\u0027t expect codec negotiation?\n\nMay be there are remotes which just want to bringup SCO connection by sending AT+BCC. I was wondering if this need to be under blacklist or so? I couldnt see much information on buganizer. Do we know what was the failure without this?",
      "parentUuid": "5d20587f_53150f09",
      "revId": "25579c921a1753ac543a2578201065a75d746888",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
